; ==============================================================================
;  config\menus\capture.rc  -  shared by the themes; no look here (icons come from variables
;  each theme defines: none; empty = no icon).
;  Screen capture tools. Variant for *Popup; menus\capture-startmenu.rc has the same entries for *PopupStartMenu.
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it. Personal additions go in
;  personal.rc (star lines there add items).
; ==============================================================================
*Popup "Recorte de pantalla (Win+Shift+S)" !Execute [ms-screenclip:]
*Popup "Herramienta Recortes (foto/vídeo)" !Execute [snippingtool.exe]
*Popup "Barra de juegos (grabar)" !Execute [explorer.exe ms-gamebar:]
